        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CATACOMB </strong>- is an atmospheric single-player indie psychological horror game. The game is set from a unique body camera like perspective </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average play time is  1 hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/extras/b3ce124a0956b4c3dea73957e188db4b.poster.avif?t=1762844490\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/extras/b3ce124a0956b4c3dea73957e188db4b.webm?t=1762844490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/extras/b3ce124a0956b4c3dea73957e188db4b.mp4?t=1762844490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What are the Catacombs?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under  Paris exists kilometers of lost tunnels and rooms—where millions were buried. You are one of the many urban explorers who find themselves lost in this underground world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you find your way out alive while a sand monster hunts you down?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate claustrophobic tunnels, crypts and subway systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve occasional puzzles to get out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Jumpscares</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All while a monster haunts and chases you. There is no crafting or inventory aspects—its mostly a psychological horror/atmospheric game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is carefully designed so that you quickly find areas of interest rather than being lost in long tunnels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/extras/63b33002945d83e5710b2f914aeef2b3.poster.avif?t=1762844490\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/extras/63b33002945d83e5710b2f914aeef2b3.webm?t=1762844490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/extras/63b33002945d83e5710b2f914aeef2b3.mp4?t=1762844490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ray Traced Spatial audio </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic body cam perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first horror game about the Paris Catacombs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All for the price of a coffee!</strong></p>",
